    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Estates are delighted to bring no.17 Ballynakelly Cottages to the market, a charming, semi detached home set in a wonderful and highly sought after location in Newcastle. While the property currently requires complete refurbishment, it presents an exciting opportunity for those looking to restore and return into a special family home and avail of the vacant home grant.\n\nAn excellent renovation opportunity offering a blank canvas requiring substantial refurbishment, with scope to create a distinctive contemporary home. Generous existing accommodation, approximately three bedrooms, reception rooms one bathroom, plus kitchen, pantry and entrance hall. Substantial 0.5 Acre site with semi detached bungalow with genuine character and original charm extending to approximately 86sqm offering plenty of scope to extend or knock and rebuild subject to the necessary planning permission.\n\nThis property offers well proportioned and versatile accommodation throughout and would make an ideal home for first time buyers, families or investors. \n\nBright and spacious throughout this property offers a comfortable layout with the potential for the new owner to put their own stamp on the property and create a comfortable and welcoming home. \n\nIdeally situated, No.17 is within walking distance to all local amenities, including shops, schools, childcare facilities and parks. There is easy access to the City Centre with an excellent bus network on the doorstep and also the N7, M50 & N4 motorways are close by. \n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the potential of this property. \n\n150 m to 68 & 6W Bus ( Luas link bus)\n450 m to Newcastle Spar\n550 m to Newcastle Supervalu\n700 m to St Finians School\n800 m to Newcastle Lidl\n900 m to Graydon Park\n4.2 km to Hazelhatch Train Station\n6.1 km to Celbridge Village\n8.3 km to Lucan\n12 km to Maynooth University via the 6w Bus\n16 km to Grafton Street Dublin\n22 km to Dublin Airport\nAll distances are approximate.\n\nEarly interest is expected, be sure to contact Kelly Estates today for further information or to arrange viewing! All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\n\nPlease note: Visit Kelly Estates on Facebook, Instagram or Tiktok for videos of the property. Early interest is expected, be sure to contact Kelly Estates today for further information or to arrange viewing! All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\n "
      },
      {
